"A Keep Awake session now survives Helm restarting. A two-hour session used to be cancelled by anything that ended the app — a silent update most often: the countdown vanished from the menu bar, the Mac was free to sleep, and nothing said so. It comes back with the time it had left, and a session whose end passed while Helm was gone stays finished." = "A Keep Awake session now survives Helm restarting. A two-hour session used to be cancelled by anything that ended the app — a silent update most often: the countdown vanished from the menu bar, the Mac was free to sleep, and nothing said so. It comes back with the time it had left, and a session whose end passed while Helm was gone stays finished.";
"A VPN carries everything this Mac sends, not only the app it names, and it takes a few seconds to come up after the app starts." = "A VPN carries everything this Mac sends, not only the app it names, and it takes a few seconds to come up after the app starts.";
"A design pass over the whole app, in the macOS 26/27 idiom: Liquid Glass on the menu-bar panel, page titles that line up with the page beneath them at any window width, text that recedes without becoming unreadable, and numbers that roll instead of cutting. The sidebar groups modules into Files and Utilities rather than putting five of seven in one pile, and the window opens wide enough for the Disk screen to show everything it measures." = "A design pass over the whole app, in the macOS 26/27 idiom: Liquid Glass on the menu-bar panel, page titles that line up with the page beneath them at any window width, text that recedes without becoming unreadable, and numbers that roll instead of cutting. The sidebar groups modules into Files and Utilities rather than putting five of seven in one pile, and the window opens wide enough for the Disk screen to show everything it measures.";
"A removal could follow a symbolic link out of the folder you confirmed and delete a different file. It cannot now." = "A removal could follow a symbolic link out of the folder you confirmed and delete a different file. It cannot now.";
"A filter hides the kinds you are not reviewing — system extensions, for instance." = "A filter hides the kinds you are not reviewing — system extensions, for instance.";
"A layout that names no country keeps its letters, in a frame the same size as a flag." = "A layout that names no country keeps its letters, in a frame the same size as a flag.";
"A new look across the app: every screen leads with its icon and the numbers that matter there, on one consistent layout." = "A new look across the app: every screen leads with its icon and the numbers that matter there, on one consistent layout.";
"A rule is a decision made once and carried out from then on, so it is shown before it is switched on." = "A rule is a decision made once and carried out from then on, so it is shown before it is switched on.";
"A short token you type often, and what it stands for. It expands when you finish the word." = "A short token you type often, and what it stands for. It expands when you finish the word.";
"A way out of a scan in Disk. The module opens on whatever it measured last, and the only button was “Scan again”, which measures the same place — so a scan of the wrong folder came back at every launch with no way to leave it. “Choose another…” beside it clears the screen and forgets the saved scan." = "A way out of a scan in Disk. The module opens on whatever it measured last, and the only button was “Scan again”, which measures the same place — so a scan of the wrong folder came back at every launch with no way to leave it. “Choose another…” beside it clears the screen and forgets the saved scan.";
"A word is checked when you finish it this way. Moving the caret or clicking elsewhere never converts — by then you have moved on." = "A word is checked when you finish it this way. Moving the caret or clicking elsewhere never converts — by then you have moved on.";
"A word is only changed when it is not a word as typed and is one once swapped. Anything valid is left alone." = "A word is only changed when it is not a word as typed and is one once swapped. Anything valid is left alone.";
