"Disk says when a folder is still being measured, and Stop really stops it. A file already gone by the time Disk tries to remove it gets its own message instead of sending you to look for it in the Finder, and the free-space tile on the panel updates again instead of freezing at what it read when Helm launched." = "Disk says when a folder is still being measured, and Stop really stops it. A file already gone by the time Disk tries to remove it gets its own message instead of sending you to look for it in the Finder, and the free-space tile on the panel updates again instead of freezing at what it read when Helm launched.";
"The Log page shows the log that is actually on disk, not only this session’s — yesterday’s crash used to be missing from the very page you would open to find it." = "The Log page shows the log that is actually on disk, not only this session’s — yesterday’s crash used to be missing from the very page you would open to find it.";
