"A Homebrew operation can be stopped, and stopping it is reported as “Stopped”, not as a failure. A brew that stops answering no longer hangs the module — Helm cuts it off and keeps the last good answer." = "A Homebrew operation can be stopped, and stopping it is reported as “Stopped”, not as a failure. A brew that stops answering no longer hangs the module — Helm cuts it off and keeps the last good answer.";
