"A folder Autopilot may never watch — a system folder, a whole disk — is refused in its own words, instead of sending you to grant Full Disk Access that would not have helped." = "A folder Autopilot may never watch — a system folder, a whole disk — is refused in its own words, instead of sending you to grant Full Disk Access that would not have helped.";
